.most useful patterns for beginners:
1. console.log() - to print out the value of variables or messages to the console for debugging purposes
2. console.error() - to print out error messages to the console
3. console.warn() - to print out warning messages to the console
4. console.table() - to display data in a tabular format in the console for easier visualization
5. console.time() and console.timeEnd() - to measure the time taken for a block of code to execute  

